# Keep host build artifacts out of the build context. Copying a host-restored obj/
# into the container breaks cross-platform restore (MSB4184 GetTargetPlatformIdentifier).
**/bin
**/obj

.git/
.github/
.idea/
.serena/
.claude/
.vs/

CamusDB.Tests/
CamusDB.Cluster.Tests/
CamusDB.Sandbox/
bench/
docs/
specs/
